source: Snider KT, Snider EJ, Degenhardt BF, et al. Palpatory accuracy of lumbar spinous processes using multiple bony landmarks. J Manipulative Physiol Ther. 2011;34:306–313. || palpatory accuracy lumbar spinous processes bony landmarks
source: Chakraverty R, Pynsent P, Isaacs K. Which spinal levels are identified by palpation of the iliac crests and the posterior superior iliac spines? J Anat. 2007;210:232–236. || spinal levels identified by palpation of the iliac crests and posterior superior iliac spines
